  "body": [
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Notes from the Map Room",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b71c2399679ffcf2dd71a6159c42448559d93fada9e032375c41775f77476b439",
      "level": 1,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The map room occupies the quiet end of the neighborhood library. Its shelves hold folded street plans, ferry schedules, and hand-drawn routes collected over several decades. A small brass weight keeps each sheet flat while readers compare editions. ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "id": "fn1",
          "type": "footnote_ref"
        }
      ],
      "id": "bb22ea46452941d4d9d8f092e7b458d795ec6438be7854d0942fe1f6fec37470c",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Mara volunteers on Thursday afternoons. She records the paper's date, the names of its surveyors, and any handwritten notes near the margins. When a street changes, she adds a transparent overlay rather than altering the older map. ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "id": "fn2",
          "type": "footnote_ref"
        }
      ],
      "id": "bbfc91d7c424d088b51db2e80794597ca3f212854172b4d9a92e300e1a5422d2d",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The archive keeps older map editions beside later revisions.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b72a847d04b084268ee8a0968656dd62cbab2ce24f281efc129399f8f2ac807c6",
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b5bb372eb2dbe0d36e6328c21b4188cd302ae70bad023cd59c771750b7709796a",
      "note_id": "fn1",
      "type": "footnote"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Catalog records are verified during regular review cycles.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b8f53748bdfa8eea8dcfb5bf75a85297374f3c1789776d7d1fa7538c4c6374ad7",
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b4955b7bc5d68ac94ad80dd6187a4d692f11a63dd147d419e5125d8c4a874591c",
      "note_id": "fn2",
      "type": "footnote"
    }
  ],
